es its frequency according to the surrounding temperature. If you're looking for a long lasting, more energy efficient AC, it is worth investing into."))),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 dividerf2 mt-40 mb-40"}," "),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 dtbl windVsSplit_wrp"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 dcell_top pr-30 column_1 "},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 font20 color111 fw700 mb-20"},"Aluminium coil Vs Copper coil"),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 font14 color555 fw400 mb-20 lh22"}," In air conditioner coils are used to convert gas refrigerant to liquid refrigerant, vice versa, which further helps to cool the room. Coils can made up of copper or aluminium depending on the manufacturer. Regards aluminium coil vs copper coil, the copper coil has high heat transfer rate, less corrosive, high coil strength. Whereas, only the best thing about the aluminium coil is cheaper, economical than copper coil. ")),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 dcell_top pl-30 column_1"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 imgbx"},u("img",{src:"https://akam.cdn.jdmagicbox.com/images/icontent/hyperlocal/bg_aluminvscopper.png",className:"jsx-2891359904"})," "))),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 dividerf2 mt-40 mb-40"}," "),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 font20 color111 fw700 mb-20"},"Additional Features"),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 font14 color555 fw400 mb-40 lh22"}," Most ACs today incorporate a variety of features aimed at providing great performance and useful health benefits. While these are important, the requirements may vary from household to household and from location to location "),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 additFeatr_wrp"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 additFeatr_bx"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 img_wrp"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 img_bx"}," ",u("img",{src:"https://akam.cdn.jdmagicbox.com/images/icontent/hyperlocal/bg_airfilter.svg",alt:"buyingguide",className:"jsx-2891359904"})," ")),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 pl-20"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 font18 color111 fw500"}," Wi-Fi"),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 font14 color555 fw400 mt-10 lh22"}," Air filters help eliminate dust, pollen and bacteria during the cooling process. These filters may need to be cleaned or replaced from time to time. Air filters are governed by the Minimum Efficiency Reporting Value (MERV) ratings "))),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 additFeatr_bx"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 img_wrp"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 img_bx"}," ",u("img",{src:"https://akam.cdn.jdmagicbox.com/images/icontent/hyperlocal/bg_dehumidification.svg",alt:"buyingguide",className:"jsx-2891359904"})," ")),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 pl-20"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 font18 color111 fw500"}," DEHUMIDIFICATION"),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 font14 color555 fw400 mt-10 lh22"}," The dehumidification feature is essential for people living close to the sea. This feature reduces the moisture level of the room while the AC is cooling in order to ensure improved comfort, especially during humid days "))),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 additFeatr_bx"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 img_wrp"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 img_bx"}," ",u("img",{src:"https://akam.cdn.jdmagicbox.com/images/icontent/hyperlocal/bg_hotcold.svg",alt:"buyingguide",className:"jsx-2891359904"})," ")),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 pl-20"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 font18 color111 fw500"}," HOT & COLD"),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 font14 color555 fw400 mt-10 lh22"}," Live in an area where the winters are extreme? This feature converts your AC into a heater and emits warm air to increase the temperature of the room and keep the cold at bay. These units are also called all weather ACS "))),u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 additFeatr_bx"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 img_wrp"},u("div",{className:"jsx-2891359904 img_bx"}," ",u("img",{src:"https://akam.cdn.jdmagicbox.com/images/icon