m to an external device becomes much easier and less chaotic for the user."))),_("div",{class:"dtbl aditnl_featurewrp",className:"jsx-3442056298"},_("div",{class:"dcell imgwrp",className:"jsx-3442056298"},_("div",{class:"imgbx",className:"jsx-3442056298"}," ",_("img",{src:"https://akam.cdn.jdmagicbox.com/images/icontent/hyperlocal/hl_shootingrate.svg",className:"jsx-3442056298"})," ")),_("div",{class:"dcell pl-30",className:"jsx-3442056298"},_("div",{class:"font20 color111 fw500 ",className:"jsx-3442056298"},"Shooting Rate (FPS)"),_("div",{class:"font14 color111 fw400 mt-10",className:"jsx-3442056298"},"When clicking pictures of moving objects, the pictures may turn out to be blurry and unclear. Cameras that have a high shooting rate (FPS) can enable photographers to click multiple clear and high-quality shots by pressing the shutter button."))),_("div",{class:"dtbl aditnl_featurewrp",className:"jsx-3442056298"},_("div",{class:"dcell imgwrp",className:"jsx-3442056298"},_("div",{class:"imgbx",className:"jsx-3442056298"}," ",_("img",{src:"https://akam.cdn.jdmagicbox.com/images/icontent/hyperlocal/hl_GPStagging.svg",className:"jsx-3442056298"})," ")),_("div",{class:"dcell pl-30",className:"jsx-3442056298"},_("div",{class:"font20 color111 fw500 ",className:"jsx-3442056298"},"GPS Tagging"),_("div",{class:"font14 color111 fw400 mt-10",className:"jsx-3442056298"},"During outdoor shoots in foreign locations, it can be hard to keep a track of the locations where the photos were shot. GPS tagging in a camera is an important feature which comes in handy when referring to the exact location of each picture taken from the camera.")))),_("div",{class:"jsx-2827645729 font16 color111 fw700 mb-15 mt-50 mob-mt-25 mob_font13",className:"jsx-3442056298"},"c. Additional Features"),_("div",{class:"dtbl mb-10 hl_tv_extradata",className:"jsx-3442056298"},_("div",{class:"dcell soundimg_wrp",className:"jsx-3442056298"},_("div",{class:"soundimgbx",className:"jsx-3442056298"}," ",_("img",{src: