hart .specification_row:nth-child(odd){background-color:#1a2e1c;}",".dark-mode .specification_chart.spcs_greenchart .specification_row:nth-child(even){background-color:#1a271b;}",".dark-mode .specification_chart.spcs_purplechart .specification_row:nth-child(odd){background-color:#241a30;}",".dark-mode .specification_chart.spcs_purplechart .specification_row:nth-child(even){background-color:#201a29;}",".dark-mode .specification_chart.spcs_redchart .specification_row:nth-child(odd){background-color:#301a24;}",".dark-mode .specification_chart.spcs_redchart .specification_row:nth-child(even){background-color:#291a22;}"]),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 hl_content_section"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 hl_container"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 hl_content_wrapper"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 landing_container"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 container_inrwrp mt-8"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 buyerguide_wrp lh22 pb-40"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font14 color111 fw400 mt-12 "},"Gaming consoles have gained popularity over the past few decades. Gaming has primarily become a mode of entertainment, however, for some individuals it is a source of recreation. Every console has its unique build quality, finding out which one is a distinct fit for your purpose can be challenging. Consoles that can be connected to a television or streaming device and handheld consoles are the two types of consoles available today. Below is a list of gaming consoles widely available in the market today:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font20 color111 fw700 mob_font15 mt-40"},"Sony Playstation 5"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font14 color111 fw400 mt-12 "},"The PS5 is the most upgraded gaming console by Sony with significant improvements over its predecessor such as frame rates, visual quality, storage and UI upgrades. The PS5 can run up to 120 FPS (Frames Per Second) when streaming heavier and ultra-detailed games at 4K resolution. 8K video quality has been promised in the future as well. The PS5 has cut down load times remarkably, thanks to its SSD. Along with the console, you are provided with a controller called the DualSense which helps the gamer have an immersive experience while giving haptic feedback. The buttons on the controllers have resistance to have a more involved trigger experience. The PS5 can also play online video and audio streaming services as a bonus."),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_wpr mt-40"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_img"},j("img",{src:"https://akam.cdn.jdmagicbox.com/images/icontent/hyperlocal/sonyplaystationgame_1.png",className:"jsx-720528839"})),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_content pl-30 pt-20 pr-30 pb-20"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font17 fw500 color111"},"Specifications :"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_chart spcs_bluechart mt-20"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"CPU:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"AMD Ryzen 7")),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"GPU:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"AMD Radeon RDNA 2")),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"RAM:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"16GB GDDR6")),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"Storage:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"825 GB SSD")),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"Weight:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"4.9 Kilograms"))))),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font20 color111 fw700 mob_font15 mt-40"},"Sony Playstation 4 Slim"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font14 color111 fw400 mt-12 "},"The PS4 Slim is the last of its generation. PS4 Slim is offered with a 1080p resolution and most games can run at 30 FPS (Frames Per Second). PS4 Slim is lighter, slimmer and runs the same interface as the PS5 but is an older version that has slower responses due to its lower hardware specifications. In the box, you are given a controller with a directional pad, four triggers, two analogue control and four interaction buttons on the right side. Since the PS4 controllers were the first ones to introduce a touchpad integrated onto the controller, the Slim has it as well."),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_wpr mt-40"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_img"},j("img",{src:"https://akam.cdn.jdmagicbox.com/images/icontent/hyperlocal/sonyplastationgame4Slim_1.png",className:"jsx-720528839"})),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_content pl-30 pt-20 pr-30 pb-20"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font17 fw500 color111"},"Specifications :"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_chart spcs_pinkchart mt-20"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"CPU:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"AMD X86 Jaguar with eight cores")),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"GPU:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"AMD Radeon Graphics Core Next")),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"RAM:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"8GB GDDR5")),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"Storage:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"1TB or 500GB HDD")),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"Weight:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"3.4 Kilograms"))))),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font20 color111 fw700 mob_font15 mt-40"},"Microsoft Xbox Series X "),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font14 color111 fw400 mt-12 "},"The Xbox series X is the most powerful gaming console in the world. It has stunning 4K graphics for native games with frame rates reaching 120 FPS (Frames Per Second) with ease. Menus and loading times are shortened to almost nothing with the help of its custom-built SSD. The hardware on the X series has a lot of potential and guarantees a smoother user experience as updates are released. In the box, it has a common Xbox control which consists of a directional pad, two analogue sticks, four trigger buttons but no touchpad. The downside of the X series is that the controllers do not come with rechargeable batteries and extra storage is sold at a premium."),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_wpr mt-40"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_img"},j("img",{src:"https://akam.cdn.jdmagicbox.com/images/icontent/hyperlocal/gamemicrosoftxboxseriesx_1.png",className:"jsx-720528839"})),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_content pl-30 pt-20 pr-30 pb-20"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font17 fw500 color111"},"Specifications :"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_chart spcs_greenchart mt-20"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"CPU:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"AMD Zen 2 with eight cores")),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"GPU:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"AMD RDNA 2")),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"RAM:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"16GB GDDR6")),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"Storage:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"1TB SSD")),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_row"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col_1 font15 color111"},"Weight:"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_col-2 font15 color111"},"4.5 Kilograms"))))),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font20 color111 fw700 mob_font15 mt-40"},"Microsoft Xbox Series S "),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font14 color111 fw400 mt-12 "},"The series S is similar to the X in features but differs in hardware. Some call it the more affordable Xbox as it costs considerably lesser than the series X. It has a resolution of 1440p and can run games at 120 frames per second. It is more compact and viable to take places. Series S is also backwards compatible like the series X. Drawbacks of the series S is that it does not have a disc drive, it cannot run 4K, it is rather underpowered for a newer generation console and has limited storage."),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_wpr mt-40"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_img"},j("img",{src:"https://akam.cdn.jdmagicbox.com/images/icontent/hyperlocal/gamemicrosoftxboxseriess_1.png",className:"jsx-720528839"})),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specification_content pl-30 pt-20 pr-30 pb-20"},j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 font17 fw500 color111"},"Specifications :"),j("div",{className:"jsx-720528839 specific